{"type":"text","timestamp":1790381685261,"sessionID":"ses_f24f18914ffepm5fbYFzcV5TQG","part":{"id":"prt_0db1079ff001TEgvwZn1z57AJf","messageID":"msg_0db105413001jYF5R2koBvEuLg","sessionID":"ses_f24f18914ffepm5fbYFzcV5TQG","type":"text","text":"The project is intentionally minimal. I’ll use a `Marker3D` root so the reusable resource remains a true editor marker, attach the typed exported state API there, and inherit the `FlashlightPoints` group through each packed-scene instance.","time":{"start":1790381685247,"end":1790381685251},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0483ee77f06578d8016ab70e71e2b487d28f6b98fe9012b181","phase":"commentary"}}}}
